*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0016
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 970
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0016.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 EMPLOY-YEARS       PIC 9(2).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 GROSS-INCOME       PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM LOAN AMOUNT
    05 LOAN-CEILING       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM INCOME-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "LOAN-CEILING=" LOAN-CEILING
    STOP RUN.
INCOME-MULTIPLE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> ESTABLISHED EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        WHEN EMPLOY-YEARS NOT LESS THAN 7
            COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = GROSS-INCOME * 4
        WHEN EMPLOY-YEARS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 2
            COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = GROSS-INCOME * 3
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = GROSS-INCOME * 2
    END-EVALUATE.
